<title>UK: BLFA prices $400 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BLFA prices $400 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Societe Generale, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESANSTALT FUER AUFBAUFINAZIERUNG</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    10.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.294   PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.669    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5-YEAR W/I U.S. TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
